ResT api 
used to send json or xml data client is not dependent on server
it allways respect all http methods
GET PUT PATCH POST DELETE
GET/USER: user read kro kro user retun kro
post/user:handle new user creation
patch/user:update user

HTTP Headers
http headers are an impotant part of the API request and response as they represent meta data associated with thw API requrest and response

http response code indicate whethe a specific http request has been nsuccesfully completed or not


STATUS CODE:

100-199: informational response


200-299:successfull response
200:OK
201:created
202:accepted

301-399:redirection messages


400-499:client erroresponse
400: bad request
401:unauthorized
403:forbidden
404: not found

500-599:server error response